    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>The bones in your body transform into a hard metal, like iron. While this can’t be perceived from the outside, your weight increases by +50%. You gain +10 Toughness and you never suffer from Broken Bone Critical Wounds unless the GM deems it plausible that the force of the attack would bend or break your metallic bones.</p>"
